{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "f83b1e5023b940047a566ab35fbffc98e1b923269833352bc512d68f4714ee70", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほど。\n最近はこういったお店が人気ですのね……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来是这样。\n最近受欢迎的都是这种店家啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
