{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1005_p", "source_sha256": "107182821e11188c9ce6931ca6daf79c817dfa2edb1fbaebdc0f07829aac4478", "ja": "なるほど、社会勉強ですね！\nあ、あと公演のブログ読みましたよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是在了解社会啊！\n啊，对了，我看了公演的部落格喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "96dbe8cd71fcdbc77e399af09bbc3e960f14124fc6341c52a5dd7fb0a71af8c1", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます……あっ！？\nまあまあまあ、そうでしたの！　あのお店が……！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你……啊！？\n哎呀哎呀哎呀，原来是这样！那间店……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bad15a9e7f9edd6dbb189c9cd331f40b2ee4dc4942e0e36acbb988dbea9dcb12", "ja": "？　千鶴さん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "嗯？千鹤，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "2bdfc33e563bb7e199cf5b83f0d20a24b6a5d8b6cff9b829186b13953fe273cf", "ja": "見てくださいまし、{$P$}！\n劇場の近くに、工事中のお店がありましたでしょう？", "zh": "{$P$}，请看这里！\n之前剧场附近不是有间店在装修吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "e97abbcf9e5fbb86215acb577314a4d1af0e5ed78606b644ce1c2798507a5bbd", "ja": "あそこに、新しいカフェができたんですの！\nほら！", "zh": "那里开了一家新的咖啡厅呢！\n你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
