{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "dfc7fc472acd35a0941e51b751103cbd98bc530f0893f0bf508caf9ab133d9d0", "ja": "と、と言っても、わたくしがはしゃいだりしては\nおかしいですわね！　おーっほっほっほっ……。", "zh": "即、即便如此，本小姐表现得这么兴奋也很奇怪吧！\n哦～呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1013_p", "source_sha256": "98d66ae11eb8cbe50b1803d34c801628ee880a683e7356e6766d91545ec7f7d2", "ja": "そうですね、千鶴さんなら本店にも\n行けるんでしょうけど……。", "zh": "说的也是，\n千鹤这样的身分，应该能直接去总店吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
