{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "ed9618f294d67a55722fc05a83af25697bc2eeeb95205164270858905de8fa9a", "ja": "ま、まあ、たしかに、視察を兼ねてもいいですけれど。\nでも、ひとりでは……。", "zh": "哎、哎呀，确实也可以顺便视察一下。\n不过一个人去有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
