{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "e80c1b7a301563517e4977e2313275cf5570d34c7a63827bef9941e60807802b", "ja": "えっ！？　い、いいんですの！？\n{$P$}、仕事があるのでは……？", "zh": "咦！？真、真的可以吗！？\n{$P$}，你不是有工作吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a98d45ba157d1978b338e839aea0e2761efedf3845a2bb631d665bbab998d25a", "ja": "ちょうど時間が空いたんです。\nそれに、公演も頑張ってくれましたし……。", "zh": "时间刚好空出来了。\n况且，你在公演时也很努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
