{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "ff430b5e78fdc49371f2df973584d04af783b41fc30d6542c2bad89452ade076", "ja": "あら、そんな……いいんですのよ。わたくしは\n大人ですし、皆のお世話をするのは当たり前ですもの。", "zh": "哎呀，这实在……你真的不用客气。\n毕竟本小姐是成年人，照顾大家也是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f42c35214cc2392ff86e9485d0276b96b4a708256971424e333e65acc043e06f", "ja": "まあ、いいじゃないですか。\n大人だって、たまには羽を伸ばさないと。", "zh": "哎，去看看也好啊。\n成年人有时也是需要放松一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "059c32e5ea010d382bdcb846008571eec32bcd841f9c2dd8d46f789b77e8602c", "ja": "そ、そう……ですわね。貴方がそこまで仰るのでしたら\n……お言葉に、甘えさせていただきますわね。", "zh": "这、这么说……也对呢。\n你都说到这个份上了……本小姐就恭敬不如从命吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_028_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "eaea1701c0a510ab022959481527ede57bda1d269895893fd65101d229f17f73", "ja": "ふふっ、そうと決まれば、さっそく……\n行きますわよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "呵呵，既然都这么决定了，我们就……\n快出发吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
